abstract: "An independently authored Proof Protocol mapping connecting NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF) 2.0 Functions, Categories, Subcategories, Profiles, and Tiers to evidence, efficacy measurements, and proof artifacts, keeping governance and other non-empirical outcomes distinct from tested efficacy."
